        "description": "marketing-campaign-on-client (matrix row mkt-form-campaign-tags). A contact and a client carry a first touch and a last touch: the campaign values and the page of a web form submission. TouchpointService::recordSubmission writes them as pipelinq's system account with OpenRegister's access checks on, never with _rbac false. firstTouch is written once, lastTouch on every submission. Both are hideOnForm and carry x-openregister.serverSet, so a form never shows them and OpenRegister's destination validator does not ask a form for them; firstTouch is immutable (writable while empty, fixed after). Neither is readOnly: OpenRegister's readOnly refuses any changed value on update, including the first, so the touch write itself would be refused. A touchpoint gains clientId and landingPage. No property changes type and none becomes required."
    },
    "components": {
        "schemas": {
            "contact": {
                "slug": "contact",
                "properties": {
                    "firstTouch": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "title": "First touch",
                        "description": "How this person first found you: the campaign values and the page of their first web form submission. Written once and never changed.",
                        "immutable": true,
                        "hideOnForm": true,
                        "x-openregister": {
                            "serverSet": true
                        },
                        "properties": {
                            "campaignId": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "title": "Campaign",
                                "description": "The campaign of the first web form submission, when it belongs to one.",
                                "format": "uuid",
                                "$ref": "campaign"
                            },
                            "campaign": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "title": "Campaign tag",
                                "description": "The utm_campaign value of the first submission.",
                                "maxLength": 100,
                                "example": "webinar-ai-voor-gemeenten"
                            },
                            "source": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "title": "Source",
                                "description": "The utm_source value of the first submission.",
                                "maxLength": 100,
                                "example": "linkedin"
                            },
                            "medium": {
